     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>El sábado, 5 de octubre de 2019, 22:17:12 (UTC-5), Juergen Niedballa  escribió:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Nubia,<div>run the following code in your R console (from the <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/DataExtraction.html#camera-operation\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/camtrapR/vignettes/DataExtraction.html%23camera-operation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460704762000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bM2W9qtYuLYc4OThBQNQd\">data extraction vignette</a>):<br><div><div style=\"overflow-x:auto;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><pre style=\"background-color:rgb(247,247,247);border-radius:3px;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap;margin-top:5px;margin-bottom:10px;padding:10px\"><code style=\"border-radius:3px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:11.9px\">camopPlot &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,112,32);font-weight:bold\">function</span>(camOp){\r\n  \r\n  which.tmp &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">grep</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">as.Date</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">colnames</span>(camOp)), <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">pattern =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;01$&quot;</span>)\r\n  label.tmp &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">format</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">as.Date</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">colnames</span>(camOp))[which.tmp], <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;%Y-%m&quot;</span>)\r\n  at.tmp &lt;-<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\"> </span>which.tmp <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102)\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">ncol</span>(camOp)\r\n  \r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">image</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">t</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">as.matrix</span>(camOp)), <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">xaxt =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;n&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">yaxt =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;n&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">col =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">c</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;red&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;grey70&quot;</span>))\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">axis</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">at =</span> at.tmp, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">labels =</span> label.tmp)\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">axis</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">2</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">at =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">seq</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">from =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">0</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">to =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">length.out =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">nrow</span>(camOp)), <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">labels =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">rownames</span>(camOp), <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">las =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">1</span>)\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">abline</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">v =</span> at.tmp, <span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">col =</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">rgb</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(64,160,112)\">0</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">0.2</span>))\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">box</span>()\r\n}</code></pre></div><p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Open Sans, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Now you an use the function, e.g.: </span></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Open Sans, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></p><pre style=\"background-color:rgb(247,247,247);border-radius:3px;color:rgb(51,51,51);white-space:pre-wrap;padding:10px;font-size:14px\"><code style=\"border-radius:3px;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:11.9px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(85,85,85);font-weight:bold\">camopPlot</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(144,32,0)\">camOp =</span> camop_problem)</code></pre><p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Open Sans, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Note that the colors may differ from the example in the vignette if you have stations with 2 or more cameras.</span></font></p></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Best regards,</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Jürgen</font></div><div><br></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ]
   ]
